WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:06.667 position:66% line:0%
<i>I remember hearing stories about Witchers.</i>

00:00:10.375 --> 00:00:11.875 line:0%
<i>Is it true what they say?</i>

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:17.708 line:0%
<i>Elves were the original sorcerers
of the continent.</i>

00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:20.500 line:0%
<i>When humans and monsters arrived,</i>

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:24.792 line:0%
<i>elves taught the humans
how to turn chaos into magic.</i>

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:28.917 position:63% line:0%
And then... the humans slaughtered them.

00:00:30.708 --> 00:00:34.625 line:0%
Chaos is the most dangerous thing
in this world.

00:00:35.583 --> 00:00:37.833 line:0%
<i>But without control,</i>

00:00:38.708 --> 00:00:39.875 line:0%
<i>chaos will kill you.</i>

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:44.292 line:0%
<i>So, that's all life is to you?</i>

00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:46.625 line:0%
Monsters and money?

00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:47.875 line:0%
It's all it needs to be.

00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:49.625 line:0%
<i>Something out there waits for you.</i>

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.417 line:0%
This child will be extraordinary.

00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:59.542 position:64% line:0%
Yennefer, imagine the most powerful woman
in the world.

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:03.542 line:0%
Do you have what it takes?

00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:07.583 line:0%
<i>Nilfgaard are here.</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.875 line:0%
<i>She's why they came.</i>

00:01:12.542 --> 00:01:16.333 position:56% line:0%
<i>You can't outrun destiny
just because you're terrified of it.</i>

00:01:16.417 --> 00:01:17.500 line:0%
It's coming.

00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:20.417 line:0%
Find Geralt of Rivia.

00:01:25.542 --> 00:01:27.417 line:0%
I can't do this without you.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.375 line:0%
<i>No matter what you choose,</i>

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:34.708 line:0%
<i>you'll come out bloody.</i>

